  "contentHtml": "<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">아래의 내용은 저희 학교 선생님들께 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">메신저로 보낸 내용입니다. 같이 고민해주시면 감사하겠습니다.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">------------------------------------------------------</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">5/15 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">목요일 운동장 주차장에 세워놓은 차량이</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">축구공에 맞아 앞 유리가 파손 되었습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp; </P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">5/16 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">금요일에도 또 한 대의 차량 유리가 파손 되었습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">현재 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">CCTV </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">녹화 동영상을 바탕으로 증거를 찾고 있습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp; </P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">아래의 내용을 함께 고민해주시면 감사하겠습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp; </P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">더 안전한 주차공간을 차지하기 위해서</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">아침 일찍 출근해서 더 안전한 장소에 재빨리 주차해야 할까요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">? ^^</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">차량 파손은 운이 안좋아 생긴 일일까요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">?</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">CCTV </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">분석 결과 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일과 시간 동안 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">fence</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">를 넘어 주차장으로 축구공</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">야구공이 떨어진 경우는</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><U style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">8</SPAN></U><U style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">회 이상</SPAN></U><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">됩니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. (</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">작년에도 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">대의 교사 차량 유리가 파손되었습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학교 뒤편의 차량도 사이드미러 파손</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">차체가 찌그러지는 등의 피해가 있었음 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">∴ </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-STYLE: italic; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">선생님도 차량 피해의 당사자가 될 수 있습니다 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-STYLE: italic; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">ㅜ ㅜ</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp; </P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">3. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">해당 학생을 찾을 경우 어떤 처벌을 해야 할까요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">?</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">CCTV </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">분석</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">전체 학생 설문조사를 통해 해당 학생을 찾아야 하구요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">교육적 차원에서 지도를 해야 합니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">좋은 인성교육 주제라고도 생각됩니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">하지만 배상 문제에 있어서는 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">운동장에서 수업활동 중에 일어난 일이고</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">고의성이 없다면 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">해당 학생에게 모든 책임을 물을 수 있을까요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">?</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp; </P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp; </P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">4. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">교직원들이 안심하고 학교 생활에 전념할 수 있고</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학생들도 신나게 체육활동을 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">할 수 있도록 학교 차원에서 마련해야할 근본적인 대책은</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">?</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학교 안전공제회나 관련 기관에 문의한 결과 해당 건은 보상이 안된다고 합니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학교 관계자</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학생</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">교직원</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">가 아닌 외부 침입자가 차량을 파손한 경우만 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">가능하다고 합니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.) </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학부모님이 학교를 방문했다가 이런 일이 생기면 누가 보상합니까</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">?</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp; </P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">* </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">혹시 학교 차원에서 가입할 수 있는 보험이 있을까요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">?</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">또 어떤 방법이 있을까요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">? </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">교총이나 전교조에 문의를 해봐야 할까요?</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">전체 교직원 협의회</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FA